        "page": 2,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s5"
      },
      "text": "CTU researchers assess with high confidence that COBALT GYPSY is associated with Iranian government-directed cyber operations, and it has used tactics similar to this campaign: targeting Saudi financial , oil, and technology organizations using job-themed lures to infect systems registering spoofed domains spearphishing new victims using legitimate email addresses",
